  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening adaptation planning processes and capacity for implementation of adaptation actions in agricultural and water sectors in Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Sudan?s capacity to assess biophysical and socio-economic risks and vulnerabilities; developing baselines and the prioritization of context specific adaptation practices in the agricultural and water sectors for transformative and paradigm shift; developing tools and methods for tracking adaptation actions; and strengthening the enabling environment to access and support GCF projects.</narrative>
  </description>
